      "beat_id": "NB01",
      "act": "1 stakes",
      "narration_text": "Things will go wrong — a plugin misbehaves, a connection drops, a result disappoints. The real risk isn't the bug. It's letting quiet frustration turn into giving up. Diagnosing keeps you in the game.",
