    {
      "beat_id": "NB02",
      "act": "2 wrong guess payoff",
      "narration_text": "Here's the discipline. The interface — buttons, menus, wording — changes constantly. Underneath sits something durable: what the plugin is for, what it can and can't do. Troubleshoot from there.",
