    {
      "beat_id": "NB03",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Most breakage takes one of five shapes: won't appear, won't authenticate, results feel generic, everything runs slow, or a command isn't recognized. Each has a durable cause — and a durable fix.",
