    {
      "beat_id": "NB04",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Plugin missing after you installed it? Plugins load when the app starts, so a mid-session install may not show yet. Close it completely, reopen it, and it loads. Still missing? Reinstall it from the sidebar.",
