    {
      "beat_id": "NB05",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "A service that won't authenticate almost always means stale credentials — a token expired, a password changed, access got revoked. Disconnect the service and reconnect it. If your company gates outside access, you may need IT's approval.",
