    {
      "beat_id": "NB07",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Slow operations usually reach outside your machine — a database lookup, a web search, a CRM query all cost more than local work. The fix is scope: ask for one date range, one folder, not everything everywhere.",
