    {
      "beat_id": "NB09",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Two quick diagnostics first. Check the plugins list to see what's installed and active — your first move for anything plugin-related. If one's misbehaving, disable it, then re-enable it. That reloads its config and clears most glitches.",
